        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omusoleeli omukhulu chana akhalala lukali, mala aloba khukhwingila munju. Nio raraawe arura enje mala amwikoonjelela engile munju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali naye akobosia raraawe ali, ‘Lola kimiiko kino kioosi nakhukholeele nga omukholi, ne se nalekhakho khuria lilaka liowo tawe, ne kakhaba kario ewe okhambakho khameeme khong'ene nalia nasangaala ne basaale base tawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omwana wowo yuno, owasasia kimiaandu kiowo ne bakhasi baeeyi, nga ne echile omwiriire euunwa enefu!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raraawe amuboolela ali, ‘Mwana wase, buli lwoosi ewe oli nase, ne bioosi nibio ndi nabio bili bibiowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khukhoyeele khukholela wandaayo naikara mala khusangaale sikila wandaayo yuno aba afwa ne luno ali omulamu, aba atiba ne luno anyoolekhe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
